      "uid": "zhcn:b1ed674963cbe5b62969ee43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀表示达成计划后将考虑回到德国，\n不过看来她已经做好\n将所有精力投注于竞赛的准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0229a752cf6df133913a02d65d579134c5f1d0625caeada2339f1c149245e5d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
