      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "遵循完美行程，进而成为值得骄傲的自己──\n我跟认真又条理分明的荣进闪耀\n一起度过的三年就此展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ae2a9941f4be1a6937b4f82c85e01c588ca69292b892aa919cd3ed4bbe53d19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
