      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀失去方向后陷入迷惘。\n为了鼓励她向前迈进，决定找曾经历挫折的\n赛马娘东海帝王谈谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72040edadc3e76671cffb60f50198af8a23cf0e4b8a1e39b6f69a5f35e283554",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
