      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王笑着回答，当时的她思索\n“憧憬的对象这时会怎么做？”之后，\n便下定决心继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa73fc1dbaa9dfe4cb1ce1155b56c9b6ec0005c10ec7fe4cebeb8353fd9e02e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
