      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过荣进闪耀已放眼下一个目标。\n即使面对“菊花赏”，\n也只要像往常一样拿出成果即可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e42115331574b26a301fddab71e7cd1d1ad20ee66ae0d9aa34e6a1a3bd728ef",
