    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85c10adf680c911a8c053ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样下去就无法赢得“天皇赏（秋）”前的\n每一场比赛，实现跟父母的约定了。\n荣进闪耀固执地这么认为──",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e088a0a26b421666061f7c5584e791b55a4d186fc6087b68fe919bb1d60609",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
