      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟醒目飞鹰讨论后，他们选择\n前往迪拜……风情的国内海滩放松身心。\n虽然荣进闪耀一开始相当困惑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "00bd574dcbecfb7774961ed0ccfdffc5f9e33fffd530867f0a5fbc7cfe7f5c43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
