      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但听到醒目飞鹰与训练员皆肯定并鼓励\n自己的为人后，她也忍不住怀疑\n做出消极的选择是否正确。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfc8dc1ac330a4d2eb2e6a02f1eafd449ec62177ed7f699562357ab4f8d3dc71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
