      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让荣进闪耀面对她自己，\n训练员想到了推她最后一把的方法──\n让她跟千明代表再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98eb14f9c5c8ef9ee74cce68a76fdf0003fc82f8401b8a9d0c7ccc1ca0e37274",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
