      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但训练员说服她，经历挫折而获得的经验\n也会是她的武器。于是她相信了训练员的话，\n勇于挑战比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a5a9b2fc128ddadf8f45f72103a545ec3fc0f03592c19eafcf240144b03a181",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
