      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然未能得胜，\n但她的跑法获得了千明代表的肯定，\n也证明了她确实有所成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "066662930a8644817ba25410accef10c9f2f3d612a286ef6687aed631090de53",
