    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bbedb2bb7e3218c35d85db7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这都是一路上坚持达成行程后的成果。\n荣进闪耀决心要靠现在的自己一决胜负，\n她转换心态，迎接“大阪杯”的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7550546152eea21a06ee62421f7893ec4c47ebc1d2c8034fd214a17797d6ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
